<main class="harness-page" aria-labelledby="harness-title">
  <header class="harness-hero">
    <div>
      <div class="evaluation-eyebrow">Agent X Evaluation</div>
      <h1 id="harness-title">Harnesses</h1>
      <p>Run full OpenClaw or Hermès profiles in a disposable workspace. These native-ceiling campaigns are evidence, not model leaderboard entries.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="r-nav-btn" href="/">Model benchmark →</a>
  </header>

  <section class="harness-card" aria-labelledby="native-run-title">
    <h2 id="native-run-title">New native-agent campaign</h2>
    <p id="harness-availability" class="harness-availability" role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking harness availability…</p>
    <label>Harness target<select id="harness-target" disabled><option value="">Loading catalog…</option></select></label>
    <label>Task<textarea id="harness-prompt" rows="8" maxlength="200000" placeholder="Describe the bounded task. Do not paste credentials, secrets, private URLs or personal data." disabled></textarea></label>
    <label class="harness-confirm"><input type="checkbox" id="harness-confirm" disabled> I confirm this task contains no credentials, secrets or private URLs.</label>
    <button type="button" id="harness-run" class="r-nav-btn r-primary" disabled>Run in disposable workspace</button>
    <div id="harness-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <pre id="harness-output" hidden></pre>
  </section>

  <section class="harness-card" aria-labelledby="campaign-history-title">
    <h2 id="campaign-history-title">Campaign evidence</h2>
    <p class="harness-note">Compare like with like: portable isolated-model runs and native-ceiling agent runs have different contracts. This view declares no universal winner across different tuples.</p>
    <div id="harness-campaigns"></div>
  </section>
</main>
